#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0014 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "The cdisc-family OPERATION-LEVEL provider-absent LIBRARY skip pin (once per mechanism in this batch; the accessor-level sibling pin lives on CDISC-CG0012). NO #library line of ANY kind - the cdisc family does not require the declaration, so the provider is null and the eagerly-probed required_variables operation yields LIBRARY_NOT_AVAILABLE -> rule SKIPPED. Uses the invalid body's DM-without-SEX (discriminating - with a provider and the required list it would fire)."
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID  type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col SITEID  type=Char label="Study Site Identifier"
---
S1 | DM | S1-001 | 001 | 01
